title: Analytics › Charts: payers, draft edits and workload
route: /analytics
intro: Three cards you read but cannot click: the payer bars, the draft-edit donut and the workload card. The fourth chart, preventable denials, has its own diagram. There are no tooltips on hover and nothing opens on a click, except the link in the workload card. They change with the period, payer and program menus (workload: payer and program only).
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'not enough decisions' on the bars and the donut cannot happen with the demo's numbers for all programs; with one small program and one payer it can. Workload is live: it counts the Dashboard's requests now.
---
start s1 "Scroll to the cards"

group gBars "Payer bars"
  screen b1 "'Approved as asked, this quarter'\nBars, best first: Lakeshore 86%, Beacon PPO 81%, Harborview MA 77%, Summit Medicaid 74%, Evergreen 69%, Cardinal 63%\nA picked program is added to the subtitle"
  decision b2 "Rate band?"
  process b3 "80 and above: green bar"
  process b4 "55 to 79: ochre bar"
  process b5 "Below 55: terracotta bar"
  screen b6 "Footnote '1,070 decisions this quarter. Green is 80 and above, ochre 55 to 79, terracotta below 55.'"
  decision b7 "A payer is chosen in the menu?"
  process b8 "Two bars: that payer, then 'All payers' for comparison\nThe payer's bar is the same number as the 'Approval rate' tile"
endgroup

group gEdit "Draft edits"
  screen d1 "'Share of drafts, this quarter'\nDonut with '68%' and 'as written' in the middle"
  screen d2 "Legend\n'Sent as written' 68% · approved 89% of the time\n'Light edits' 27% · approved 76%\n'Rewritten' 5% · approved 45%"
  screen d3 "'966 drafts this quarter.'"
  decision d4 "Fewer than 20 drafts?\n(no demo view gets here)"
  screen d5 "'Not enough decisions yet. Figures based on fewer than 20 decisions stay hidden.'"
endgroup

group gWork "Workload"
  screen h1 "'Workload'\n'Requests on the Dashboard right now'\nLink 'Open the Dashboard'"
  process h2 "Two big numbers and a meter\n'8 handled' and '32 still open' at the start\nHandled means the payer has decided, the same as 'Decided today' on the Dashboard"
  process h3 "Follows the payer and program menus, not the period\nA line names the scope, then says how many open requests wait on you"
  store h4 "Live: answer a payer in the Dashboard, or accept a denial in Denial Intelligence, and the numbers move by one"
  click h5 "Click 'Open the Dashboard'"
  goto h6 "Continues in: Dashboard › Arrive › What the page shows"
endgroup

process p1 "Hover and click do nothing on bars, donut slices, legend and meter"
end e1 "Cards read"
endx e2 "No drill-down: rows are not links"

s1 --> b1 & d1 & h1
b1 --> b2
b2 -->|80 and above| b3 --> b6
b2 -->|55 to 79| b4 --> b6
b2 -->|Below 55| b5 --> b6
b6 --> b7
b7 -->|Yes| b8 --> e1
b7 -->|No| e1
d1 --> d2 --> d3 --> d4
d4 -->|No| e1
d4 -->|Yes| d5 --> e1
h1 --> h2 --> h3 --> h4 --> e1
h1 --> h5 --> h6
s1 -.-> p1 --> e2
